Capacitor's Bridge.Builder#create() calls Cordova ConfigXmlParser.parse(),
which resolves res/xml/config.xml by the name "config" through
Resources.getIdentifier().

scripts/build-frontend-web.sh and scripts/inject-native-auth-bridge.mjs read
api_base_url from strings.xml and inject it into the packaged web runtime.
